{"type":"text","id":"intro","style":"intro","body":"Brown butter is the flavor move, while regular butter is usually easier, moister, and more forgiving."}
{"type":"sectionHeader","id":"h-sbs","title":"Quick side by side","subtitle":"The main tradeoff is deeper flavor versus ease, yield, and predictability."}
